 "canon": {
  "title": "No Neutral Ledger",
  "purpose": "Oruun-of-Seven-Stones turns the exact ten-record campaign ledger into one of twenty-seven explicit plans: secure the founding doctrine's inherited route, integrate the two powered districts' contributions, attest both neutral evidence channels, apply only the recorded Lume protocol, and rally the coalition at its public site.",
